sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant AgentService@{ "type": "boundary"} as Agent Service
    participant Repository
    participant Orchestrator@{"type":"control"}
    participant FileSelector as File Selector Agent
    participant DeepScan as Scan Agents
    participant Models as Chinou Models
    participant Store@{"type":"database"} as A2A Task Store

    User->>Frontend: Provide repository name and custom prompt
    Frontend->>AgentService: POST /a2a Start security scan

    AgentService->>Repository: Clone repository
    Repository-->>AgentService: Return repository files index

    AgentService->>Orchestrator: File Index
    Orchestrator->>Store: Store Initial request & file index
    Store-->>Orchestrator: Task ID
    Orchestrator-->>AgentService:
    AgentService-->>Frontend: Task ID

    Orchestrator->>FileSelector: Select potentially vulnerable files
    FileSelector->>Models: Get Vunerable files(Max 50)
    Models-->>FileSelector:
    FileSelector-->>Orchestrator: Return top 50 files
    Orchestrator-->>AgentService: 
    AgentService-->>Frontend: 50 files + content

    loop For each agent (recon, taint, pattern, logic, deep)
        par For each selected file (1 -> 50)
            Orchestrator->>DeepScan: Analyze file using custom prompt
            DeepScan->>Models: Perform analysis based on prompts
            Models-->>DeepScan: Return findings
            DeepScan-->>Orchestrator: 
            Orchestrator->>Store: Store agent response artifacts
            Orchestrator-->>AgentService: 
            AgentService-->>Frontend: Scan Result for phase+file
        end
    end

    Orchestrator-->>Frontend: Return final scan results
    Frontend->>Frontend: Summary generation
    Frontend-->>User: Display vulnerabilities